{"id":"571700330","kind":"article","title":"条目","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Item"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-10-09","updated":"2022-10-09","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":478,"keywords":["SuperMemo","间隔重复","记忆卡片","检索练习","学习材料"],"summary":"词条将 SuperMemo“条目”解释为学习者希望记住的知识，通常以抽认卡形式呈现，可采用问答、填空或其他刺激—反应形式。它区分用于主动回忆的条目与供后续处理的摘录，并说明条目集合称为学习集。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/571700330","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Hju90f_E\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 中的<b>条目</b>是指学生想要记住的知识。条目基本上等同于抽认卡。例如：</p><p data-pid=\"WFSQ9vXy\"><b>问</b>：「哥白尼在何年逝世？」</p><p data-pid=\"fp6cLyxA\"><b>答</b>：「1543 年」</p><p data-pid=\"o0Mju42Y\"><b>条目</b>可以是简单的一问一答，或<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Cloze_deletion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">填空题</a>，或拼写测试，或是更一般的刺激-反应对。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_for_Windows\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo for Windows</a> 中的<b>条目</b>以 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://help.supermemo.org/wiki/Building_the_knowledge_tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">L 形蓝色背景图标</a>表示。（译注：西方国家刚拿驾照的新手会在汽车上贴 L 形贴纸，L 表示 Learner，具体参考维基百科）</p><p data-pid=\"6433TTWS\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">渐进阅读</a>时，可以利用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Cloze_deletion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">挖空</a>工具来大量生成<b>条目</b>（通常只需敲击一下键盘）。</p><p data-pid=\"TMJ0pjQG\"><b>条目</b>与<b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Topic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">摘录</a></b>有所不同。摘录是用于被动复习或需要进一步处理的学习材料（例如网络文章）。<b>条目</b>用于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Active_recall\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">主动回忆</a>，而摘录是新增<b>条目</b>的主要来源。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a> 中的<b>条目</b>集合被称为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Collection\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习集</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"bZmu0BN7\">条目在其他应用中的别名：<b>卡片</b>、<b>问题</b>等。</p><blockquote data-pid=\"TuCViZ3y\">本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语表</a>条目用于解释 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_Guru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，一位自 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1987</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup> 年以来的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>软件先驱。</blockquote><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"z0gL-YbR\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Item\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Item - supermemo.guru</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 什么是 SuperMemo <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 《间隔重复的历史》 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 间隔重复（spaced repetition） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"305651556\" href=\"#/post/305651556\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"566834806","title":"「跳过」：指数补偿的延迟机制和模糊收件箱","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":7,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"572444486","title":"重复","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"305651556","title":"间隔重复 (spaced repetition)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":38,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"559705516","title":"学校让人沾染上的 100+ 恶习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8728,"minutes":132,"reason":"延伸引用本文"},{"id":"602150910","title":"学习的乐趣","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":1152,"minutes":88,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆卡片」· Derek Sivers"},{"id":"403597788","title":"间隔重复记忆卡片应该明确地产生一个具体的答案","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆卡片」· Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"578902325","title":"卡片写作的模拟教学法","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆卡片」· Issa Rice"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「检索练习」· SuperMemo"},{"id":"412393170","title":"复习环节能为卡片写作提供多少反馈？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「记忆卡片」· Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[]}